{"channelId":"UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","row":["Banfield Pet Hospital",19300,"Experience pet care made easy with an Optimum Wellness Plan®. Share your pet videos using #BanfieldPetHospital 🐶😺\n\nFounded in Portland, Ore. in 1955, Banfield is the largest general-veterinary practice in the world. In 2007, Banfield joined the Mars, Inc. family of businesses, and today has more than 1,000 hospitals across the United States and Puerto Rico. More than 3,500 Banfield veterinarians are committed to providing high-quality veterinary care for over three million pets annually. In 2018, Banfield, including the work of the Banfield Foundation, was named among Points of Light’s The Civic 50 as one of the most community-minded companies in the U.S. for the second consecutive year.\n\nPage subject to mars.com/legal & mars.com/privacy. Mars is not responsible for content or activity made available via 3rd party sites/services.\n\nmars.com/privacy • mars.com/legal","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:52.570Z","channelId":"UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6263abb5ca7e0741f7ef9323ddb5e0d9fff7569dcc99d50c14e7d12bed06188b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cf37866b9d0f49c9951d5f1af70bfe77afe31561e005df96a248621f0fd9262d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:23:41.126Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":19300,"raw":"19.3K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFGDl6vnQ-lB6FhJmxT-Dxw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:52.570Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.banfield.com/","hasForm":true,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:2